abstract: >-
  Comparative-genomic analysis of lineage structure and molecular composition of
  microbial survival and resource-acquisition repertoires across seven
  metagenome-assembled genome catalogues, with an additional dryland catalogue
  and an AI-prioritized protein family (DPFQ008) case study.
